  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2017" />
  <History Date="11-09-09" Author="David Hunt" Comment="Created from wash" />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed duplicate ID's.  Increased wheel resolution for 16bit attr." />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved main CMY functions into else condition.  Fixed highlight." />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed macros to return to open shutter and added CMY to Reset" />
  <History Date="21-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Reworked Gobo to simplify index ranges and add correct random CMY options." />
  <History Date="23-01-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed power on and locate" />
  <History Date="19-04-13" Author="RDM Sync Tool" Comment="Added RDM Manufacturer information." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="26-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Merged some of the history to reduce length.  Standardised shutter.  Revised P/T Speed wheel direction." />
  <History Date="26-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added gobo numbers to function names.  Added gobo function index.  Recreated palettes." />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
